ulation of this application does not guarantee the design, size, range of motion, etc. of the actual robot.\nWhen actually installing a robot, please check the specifications on the product page.\n- Please be careful of your surroundings when using this app.", "short_description": "You can place OVR series virtual robots in real space and simulate operation.\nThe OVR series is a robot sold by Oriental Motor."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1594860848028062", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210390_1594860854694728_1273340538204967659_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pHAhdXUfSncQ7kNvwGxPAy5&_nc_oc=AdpHRbYOE349ofVT2yBdqjiPpzXfhjTosU7vjzlqa49nj10KisJ5jJGytbR6fpiAw_Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSETXA9SjO-iD4tylHqeyINYW5wZBWil6p9Z8v-f1PSkA&oe=6AFC6756"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscapeMini.png", "id": "858590429630683", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_858590432964016_3799015126354441121_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xBIXi0zSrKcQ7kNvwGrkP8v&_nc_oc=AdrH9u0w2EjOnVDeadn5bNvgt7HxovlHKAf1440RuCSX4vy9H-fIbsOgD-meiukgmnM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQWb8xFuzRAKCY2fQzaIvgrewtxx9fQDwEvx8utPjYueQ&oe=6AFC6ADC"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscape.png", "id": "495376463065176", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_495376466398509_7417159219708782199_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9CAEoUHgHd8Q7kNvwH1zldR&_nc_oc=AdoJHMF1jxVu6Zd1Kn7mcJE_PqDRggPjqAe4JYdnfNWm4A4v_ZXtAzwOBbLcLDEy0zA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQjv3EB2Gt7P3eu6NHz_o59Dzr5TX1MeHhbXD_Z5ILesQ&oe=6AFC845B"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtPortrait.png", "id": "486